OL,3,GNEWSAFire crews tackle blaze at former
OL,4,Aprivate school
OL,5,
OL,6,FFire crews have been tackling a blaze
OL,7,Fat a former private school in South
OL,8,FLanarkshire which closed amid a probe
OL,9,Finto allegations of "misconduct".
OL,11,FSix fire engines and specialist
OL,12,Fresources were sent to Fernhill School
OL,13,Fin Rutherglen at about 20:50.
OL,15,FThe school closed in June, a day
OL,16,Fearlier than planned, with some staff
OL,17,Fgoing without their pay and liquidators
OL,18,Fremoving items from the building.
OL,20,FThe Scottish Fire and Rescue Service
OL,21,F(SFRS) said there had been no report of
OL,22,Fany casualties.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
